{"title":"2015 CEMC CTMC Problems/Individual Problem 4","text":"<div class=\"mw-content-ltr mw-parser-output\" lang=\"en\" dir=\"ltr\"><h2><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"Problem\">Problem</span><span class=\"mw-editsection\"><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">[</span><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=2015_CEMC_CTMC_Problems/Individual_Problem_4&amp;action=edit&amp;section=1\" title=\"Edit section: Problem\">edit</a><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">]</span></span></h2>\n<p>The pair <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/2/9/3/293688333da28eaba63eba03427c8809e5193490.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$(x, y) = (2, 5)$\" style=\"vertical-align: -5px\" width=\"109\" height=\"20\" /> is the solution of the system of equations\n<img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/1/6/8/16876c2443a4dd33e28e9cbc65d3bdd668000acb.png\" class=\"latexcenter\" alt=\"\\[ax + 2y = 16\\]\" width=\"102\" height=\"15\" />\n<img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/5/0/a/50a158cf6eb97dfb326ca3725d84175a4f7071d8.png\" class=\"latexcenter\" alt=\"\\[3x - y = c\\]\" width=\"83\" height=\"15\" />\nDetermine the value of <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/8/3/6/8362dd17da7c07cedd4018d589a0b21e9575e287.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$\\frac{a}{c}$\" style=\"vertical-align: -12px\" width=\"12\" height=\"33\" />.\n</p>\n<h2><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"Solution_1\">Solution 1</span><span class=\"mw-editsection\"><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">[</span><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=2015_CEMC_CTMC_Problems/Individual_Problem_4&amp;action=edit&amp;section=2\" title=\"Edit section: Solution 1\">edit</a><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">]</span></span></h2>\n<p>Plugging in <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/2/e/f/2effc7979b1c93e59356b73253d75e2740b33105.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$x = 2$\" style=\"vertical-align: -1px\" width=\"46\" height=\"14\" /> and <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/8/8/9/889f56ce08684be3b2ab9914892de17686ae9594.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$y = 5$\" style=\"vertical-align: -3px\" width=\"42\" height=\"16\" /> into the equations, we have:\n</p><p><img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/9/6/7/967170a4c7aa5a470c63388e3136d7db503472bc.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$2a + 2 \\times 5 = 16$\" style=\"vertical-align: -2px\" width=\"126\" height=\"15\" />\n</p><p><img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/9/0/5/905810d3fdd818c92bb4827fd6393256d53796e4.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$3 \\times 2 - 5 = c$\" style=\"vertical-align: -2px\" width=\"106\" height=\"15\" />\n</p><p><img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/1/a/e/1aef99722f9157f960e0edbe36082b2187cba785.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$2a + 10 = 16$\" style=\"vertical-align: -2px\" width=\"103\" height=\"15\" />\n</p><p><img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/8/5/5/855f616b278a60f286df2ad31ab83d5fa264344f.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$6 - 5 = c$\" style=\"vertical-align: -2px\" width=\"74\" height=\"15\" />\n</p><p><img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/2/3/6/23653504b20102c2895ad18508a2f5da9afde078.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$2a = 16 - 10 = 6$\" style=\"vertical-align: -2px\" width=\"137\" height=\"15\" />\n</p><p><img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/5/3/5/5351998230e216d9d0f2884c159326cfe6622263.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$c = 1$\" style=\"vertical-align: 0px\" width=\"40\" height=\"12\" />\n</p><p><img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/3/8/0/3808a675e05e62b33a894f8b79267cedce96ca61.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$a = \\frac{6}{2} = 3$\" style=\"vertical-align: -13px\" width=\"82\" height=\"38\" />\n</p><p>After this, we see that <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/b/4/e/b4e1d9b05e7c4cf1e5a7178bcd168c3f2e2735ce.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$\\frac{a}{c} = \\frac{3}{1} = \\boxed{3}$\" style=\"vertical-align: -13px\" width=\"97\" height=\"38\" />\n</p><p>~anabel.disher\n</p>\n<table class=\"wikitable\" style=\"margin:0.5em auto; font-size:95%; border:1px solid black; width:80%;\">\n<tbody><tr>\n<td style=\"background:#ccf;text-align:center;\" colspan=\"3\"><b><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=2015_CEMC_CTMC\" title=\"2015 CEMC CTMC\">2015 CEMC CTMC</a></b> (<b><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=2015_CEMC_CTMC_Problems&amp;action=edit&amp;redlink=1\" class=\"new\" title=\"2015 CEMC CTMC Problems (page does not exist)\">Problems</a></b> • <b><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=2015_CEMC_CTMC_Answer_Key&amp;action=edit&amp;redlink=1\" class=\"new\" title=\"2015 CEMC CTMC Answer Key (page does not exist)\">Answer Key</a></b> • <a rel=\"nofollow\" class=\"external text\" href=\"https://cemc.math.uwaterloo.ca/contests/past_contests.html\">Resources</a>)\n</td></tr>\n<tr>\n<td width=\"50%\" align=\"center\" rowspan=\"1\">Preceded&#160;by<br /><b><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=2015_CEMC_CTMC_Problems/Individual_Problem_3&amp;action=edit&amp;redlink=1\" class=\"new\" title=\"2015 CEMC CTMC Problems/Individual Problem 3 (page does not exist)\">Individual Problem 3</a></b>\n</td>\n<td width=\"50%\" align=\"center\" rowspan=\"1\">Followed&#160;by<br /><b><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=2015_CEMC_CTMC_Problems/Individual_Problem_5&amp;action=edit&amp;redlink=1\" class=\"new\" title=\"2015 CEMC CTMC Problems/Individual Problem 5 (page does not exist)\">Individual Problem 5</a></b>\n</td></tr>\n<tr>\n<td colspan=\"3\" style=\"text-align:center;\"><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=2015_CEMC_CTMC_Problems/Individual_Problem_1\" title=\"2015 CEMC CTMC Problems/Individual Problem 1\">Individual 1</a> <b>•</b> <a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=2015_CEMC_CTMC_Problems/Individual_Problem_2&amp;action=edit&amp;redlink=1\" class=\"new\" title=\"2015 CEMC CTMC Problems/Individual Problem 2 (page does not exist)\">Individual 2</a> <b>•</b> <a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=2015_CEMC_CTMC_Problems/Individual_Problem_3&amp;action=edit&amp;redlink=1\" class=\"new\" title=\"2015 CEMC CTMC Problems/Individual Problem 3 (page does not exist)\">Individual 3</a> <b>•</b> <a class=\"mw-selflink selflink\">Individual 4</a> <b>•</b> <a href=\"/